this directory contains usefull scripts that can be used with the main program.It is not necessary for end user to run them, but they can be run by package maintainer.

To update the ethernet vendor codes (var/ieee_ethercodes.dat)
and the port numbers (var/portnumbers.dat, from the IANA registry):
  cd var ; ../contrib/updatevar.sh                  (Wireshark manuf file, updated weekly from IEEE)
  cd var ; ../contrib/updatevar.sh oui.csv mam.csv oui36.csv iab.csv   (official IEEE registries)
